# Trained models are regenerable: `python scripts/train_models.py` rebuilds
# all six byte-identically from the fixed seed. Only the model the app needs
# at runtime is versioned, so a fresh clone can play without training first.
# The others are large for a silly reason: a tree node stores a 117-class
# distribution, so an unpruned forest runs to hundreds of megabytes.
models/object_*.pkl
!models/object_best_model.pkl
